skinparam activityEndColor #F3BD62
title KubeQuest - inactivity expiration (illustrative)
robust "Session" as S
robust "Warning" as W
concise "Activity" as A
@0
S is Ready
W is Hidden
A is "Input"
@28
S is Ready
W is Visible
A is "None"
@29
A is "Keep alive"
W is Hidden
S is Ready
@57
A is "None"
W is Visible
@59
S is Stopped
W is Hidden
@60
A is "New start allowed"
@0 <-> @28 : 28 minutes without activity
@29 <-> @59 : expiry renewed for 30 minutes
legend bottom
Polling and resource streaming do not renew inactivity.
A timed exam deadline is separate from inactivity expiry.
endlegend
@enduml
